{
  "_comment": [
    "STATUS-WORDS-1. What a machine IS NOW, as the run page says it: one status",
    "for the row, the panel, the badges, the counters and the wave line. The",
    "page asks help.js (VmfHelp.machineStatus); tests/js/machine-status.test.js",
    "runs it over every case. The status reads the state document AND the latest",
    "step: the lines of the run history for this machine (live.events), and a",
    "restore or a finish the page found running (live.restoring).",
    "Every case also gives the end result the service counts (outcome): the",
    "service's Get-VmfMachineOutcome and help.js's machineOutcome are both held",
    "to it here, as well as to machine-outcomes.json",
    "(tests/unit/MachineStatus.Tests.ps1). Found on a lab install: the status",
    "said the step that failed during the whole rollback, Preparing for 13",
    "minutes while the machine was moved, Migrated beside Restoring, and Needs",
    "attention after a restore that worked."
  ],
